msgctxt "10\t184"
msgid "Her name was Haruka.\\\\nShe was just 9 years old."
msgstr "Si chiamava Haruka.\\\\nAveva solo 9 anni."

msgctxt "211\t373"
msgid "She had come to the city by herself to\\\\nlook for her mother."
msgstr "Era venuta in città da sola\\\\nper cercare sua madre."

msgctxt "385\t570"
msgid "Our meeting was coincidental,\\\\nbut we did have one thing in common."
msgstr "Il nostro incontro fu casuale,\\\\nma avevamo qualcosa in comune."

msgctxt "583\t654"
msgid "What are you going to do now?"
msgstr "E adesso cosa farai?"

msgctxt "720\t875"
msgid "My mother and Yumi are all I have..."
msgstr "Mia madre e Yumi sono tutto ciò che ho..."

msgctxt "917\t943"
msgid "Yumi...?"
msgstr "Yumi...?"

msgctxt "962\t1100"
msgid "This girl who was searching for her\\\\nmother also knew Yumi."
msgstr "Quella bambina che cercava sua madre\\\\nconosceva anche Yumi."

msgctxt "1153\t1353"
msgid ""
"Maybe it was fate that brought us together.\\\\nShe and I proceeded to find "
"the truth."
msgstr ""
"Forse fu il destino a unirci.\\\\nLei ed io procedemmo insieme alla ricerca della verità."

msgctxt "1443\t1464"
msgid "However..."
msgstr "Però..."

msgctxt "1589\t1671"
msgid "That's the girl we're lookin' for."
msgstr "È quella la bambina che stiamo cercando."

msgctxt "1672\t1692"
msgid "Wha⑬?"
msgstr "Cosa⑬?"

msgctxt "1698\t1907"
msgid ""
"The Tojo Clan believed Haruka was the\\\\nkey to the missing 10 billion yen."
msgstr ""
"Il Clan Tojo credeva che Haruka fosse la chiave\\\\nper ritrovare i 10 miliardi di yen scomparsi."

msgctxt "1946\t1998"
msgid "We were on the run day after day."
msgstr "Eravamo in fuga giorno dopo giorno."

msgctxt "2018\t2153"
msgid "I did my best to protect Haruka while\\\\nlooking for Yumi and the money."
msgstr "Feci del mio meglio per proteggere Haruka\\\\nmentre cercavo Yumi e il denaro."

msgctxt "2301\t2456"
msgid "It was then that we met a detective."
msgstr "Fu allora che incontrammo un detective."

msgctxt "2509\t2620"
msgid "Makoto Date.\\\\nFormerly of Investigations Division 1."
msgstr "Makoto Date.\\\\nEx membro della Prima Divisione Investigativa."

msgctxt "2649\t2832"
msgid "His investigation of me had twisted\\\\nhis outlook on life."
msgstr "L'indagine che aveva condotto su di me\\\\ngli aveva distorto la visione della vita."

msgctxt "2840\t2997"
msgid ""
"And now he had come to ask for my help\\\\nin getting his career back on "
"track."
msgstr ""
"E ora era venuto a chiedermi aiuto\\\\nper rimettere in carreggiata la sua carriera."

msgctxt "3061\t3250"
msgid "I'm investigating Chairman Sera's murder.\\\\nHelp me out."
msgstr "Sto indagando sull'omicidio del Presidente Sera.\\\\nAiutami."

msgctxt "3700\t3822"
msgid "An ex<Sign:22>yakuza and a detective."
msgstr "Un ex<Sign:22>yakuza e un detective."

msgctxt "4115\t4215"
msgid "We had been brought together by a strange\\\\ntwist of fate."
msgstr "Un bizzarro scherzo del destino\\\\nci aveva uniti."

msgctxt "4239\t4351"
msgid "And eventually, we became friends."
msgstr "E alla fine diventammo amici."

msgctxt "4421\t4452"
msgid "However..."
msgstr "Però..."

msgctxt "4530\t4683"
msgid "Kazuma Kiryu!\\\\nYou're under arrest for kidnapping!"
msgstr "Kazuma Kiryu!\\\\nSei in arresto per sequestro di persona!"

msgctxt "4717\t4842"
msgid ""
"Police Chief Sudo had made it his personal\\\\nmission to find Haruka and me."
msgstr ""
"Il capo della polizia Sudo si era fatto\\\\nun punto d'onore di trovare me e Haruka."

msgctxt "4843\t4874"
msgid "Date!"
msgstr "Date!"

msgctxt "4896\t4940"
msgid "Sorry I'm late."
msgstr "Scusa il ritardo."

msgctxt "4941\t5003"
msgid "Are you sure you want to do this?"
msgstr "Sei sicuro di volerlo fare?"

msgctxt "5062\t5093"
msgid "Let's get out of here, Kazuma."
msgstr "Andiamocene, Kazuma."

msgctxt "5190\t5284"
msgid "Date was caught between us and the police⑬"
msgstr "Date si trovò nel mezzo, tra noi e la polizia⑬"

msgctxt "5310\t5370"
msgid "⑬and he chose us."
msgstr "⑬e scelse noi."
